SUMMARY OF SCHEME mate méte mite mōte mite rack réck rick réck riick cawl cowl coil bak boor dowry mare mêre mire mére mure part pert port stéol stdod Noreg Or X g; S, y, as in get, set, yet ch, sh, zh, sounds in witch, wish,
===
**SUMMARY OF SCHEME**

	māte mēte mīte mōte mūte
	răck rĕck rĭck rŏck rŭck
	c*aw*l c*ow*l c*oi*l b*ah* b*oor* d*owr*y
	māre mēre mīre mōre mūre
	părt pĕrt pŏrt stōol stŏod
