<<<
physician, doctor, surgeon, in ordinary parlance. ‘ The p.’ & ‘ the d.’ may be used to denote the same person, viz one whose vocation is to heal physical troubles, p. being the FORMAL WORD, & no particular relation to s. being implied by either.
===
**physician, doctor, surgeon,** in ordinary parlance. 'The p.' & 'the d.' may be used to denote the same person, viz one whose vocation is to heal physical troubles, *p.* being the ^^FORMAL WORD^^, & no particular relation to *s.* being implied by either.
